# What Claude Code writes under .claude/ during a session and never belongs
# in the tree: locks, the per-machine settings, logs, caches, the audit
# ledgers and logs of the review rounds, session state and worktrees. The
# block between the markers is the tool's own list.
###> claude code ###
scheduled_tasks.lock
settings.local.json
logs/
.cache/
audits/
sessions/
worktrees/
